  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia partner learning exchange and training on complaints handling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims for all Colombia partners to meet and, in the light of the Andes Team&apos;s revised regional strategy and in the context of Laudato Si&apos;, to understand where synergies exist and opportunities for working together. It also aims to provide partners with a face to face opportunity to understand and discuss the requirements of the new PFA and its implications for their work and the communities they serve. The partner workshop is being held to provide the foundation for partners to work on accountability and put in place a feedback and complaints mechanisms, based on sharing experiences of strong partners that have already developed these mechanisms and taking into account experiences of other sister agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
